00:00:08.345 --> 00:00:10.594
will solve all of the
world's major problems.

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:12.408
So to help you on your journey today,

00:00:12.408 --> 00:00:13.830
I'm going to talk about the seven ways

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.307
