00:13:35.469 --> 00:13:37.569
I really, really, really
appreciate the support,

00:13:37.569 --> 00:13:40.362
and I'm so glad that you enjoyed my book.

00:13:40.362 --> 00:13:41.807
So thank guys so much for watching.

00:13:41.807 --> 00:13:43.012
I believe in you.

00:13:43.012 --> 00:13:44.656
I hope you continue to
